# Insight Extensions (Workspace)

## Domain List

Valid domains for this workspace:
`inference | pipeline | routing | security | federation | tooling | rag`

## Engram Docs

If the insight has **durable architectural significance** — it shapes how the system
should be built going forward — also write or update `docs/engram/{slug}.md`.
Engram docs are gitignored (local only, indexed by RAG). They provide the persistent
design-principle version while the discovery entry is the timestamped observation.

Not every discovery warrants an engram. Model behavior findings rarely do.
Architectural insights often do. Use judgment.

## RAG Indexing

```bash
curl -sf -X POST http://localhost:8100/index \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"path": "ABSOLUTE_PATH_TO_DISCOVERY_FILE"}'

curl -sf -X POST http://localhost:8100/index \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"path": "/mnt/torus/projects/universal-llm-gateway/tasks/discoveries/index.yaml"}'
```

If an engram doc was written, index that too. If RAG is down, note and move on.
